{'symbol': 'FI', 'date': '2021-07-26 08:00:00', 'title': "FRANK'S INTERNATIONAL RECEIVES INAUGURAL 2021 MOST VALUABLE PARTNER AWARD FROM SUPERMAJOR OPERATOR", 'text': 'HOUSTON, JULY 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0FRANK\'S INTERNATIONAL (NYSE: FI) (THE "COMPANY" OR "FRANK\'S") IS PROUD TO ANNOUNCE IT HAS RECEIVED THE INAUGURAL 2021 MOST VALUABLE PARTNER (MVP) AWARD FROM A SUPERMAJOR OPERATOR IN RECOGNITION OF FRANK\'S WORK IN GUYANA. THE OPERATOR CONSIDERED THE OUTSTANDING PERFORMANCE OF FRANK\'S TEAMS ACROSS SEVERAL CATEGORIES, INCLUDING "SAFETY, SECURITY, HEALTH AND ENVIRONMENT (SSHE) EXCELLENCE;" "RELIABILITY;" "ADAPTABILITY & PROACTIVITY;" AND "TRULY WORKING AS A PARTNER" TO PROVIDE THE HIGHEST LEVEL OF SERVICE AND SAFETY TO LOWER THE OVERALL COST OF WELL OWNERSHIP.'}